      "source": "Play Store",
      "tags": [
        "classic keyword",
        "Articulation",
        "Initial Results"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Half of my date searches now return zero results unless I use very specific (unintuitive) date formats. Photos repeat when scrolling search results, and the results aren’t as relevant as they were in the past.",
      "confidence": 0.99,
