      "tags": [
        "classic keyword",
        "Initial Results",
        "Intent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before a week ago I could type in a search for a photo and the relevant photos would be shown. Now I can type in exactly the same search and thousands appear, the vast majority of no relevance.",
